{"version":1,"content":"<p>冬日氣息漸濃，又是品嘗新菜式的好時機。</p><p>中菜講究不時不食，當季食材配上師傅巧手，最是美味。</p><p>再加上有餐廳請來內地大廚作聯乘菜式，以及美味的火鍋自助餐，都能為冬日帶來美味享受。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;滋補特選&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.143256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"7a3ec219ad616e27c7e4d086d8fe19cf585a039659c2772f8ff73399dc8da1fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}